Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_RhysIntro:
	.string "Walking on a bike road?\n"
	.string "Bold! Let's see what you've got!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_RhysDefeated:
	.string "My chain snapped!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_RhysPostBattle:
	.string "The river under this bridge is\n"
	.string "where our swimmers train.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_NovaIntro:
	.string "Runners own this deck!\n"
	.string "Catch me if you can!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_NovaDefeated:
	.string "You caught me!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_NovaPostBattle:
	.string "Stamina is half the sport.\n"
	.string "Your legs look ready.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_TobiasIntro:
	.string "A battle right in the bend!\n"
	.string "This is my favorite turn.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_TobiasDefeated:
	.string "Cornered fair and square.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_TobiasPostBattle:
	.string "The river gets loud under the\n"
	.string "next stretch. Watch your step.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_SumiIntro:
	.string "I swim the river under this\n"
	.string "bridge every morning!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_SumiDefeated:
	.string "I'm out of my depth!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_SumiPostBattle:
	.string "Need a break from the deck?\n"
	.string "Walk under the bridge instead.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_PiperIntro:
	.string "Bend after bend, battle after\n"
	.string "battle! Race me to the finish!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_PiperDefeated:
	.string "A photo finish, and you won.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_PiperPostBattle:
	.string "Past the next bend, it's all\n"
	.string "straight road.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_EnzoIntro:
	.string "Last of the triathletes!\n"
	.string "Swim, ride, run... and battle!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_EnzoDefeated:
	.string "Totally spent.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_EnzoPostBattle:
	.string "The end of the road is just\n"
	.string "ahead. Good luck out there!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_ColeIntro:
	.string "I came back from the Safari\n"
	.string "Challenge with a full bug box!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_ColeDefeated:
	.string "My bugs got squished!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_ColePostBattle:
	.string "Safari bugs are tougher than\n"
	.string "they look.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_DrewIntro:
	.string "I camped under the bridge last\n"
	.string "night. Feel like a battle?$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_DrewDefeated:
	.string "I lost my footing!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_DrewPostBattle:
	.string "It's cozy under the deck, even\n"
	.string "with all the traffic above.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_LenaIntro:
	.string "My Safari Challenge was a bust.\n"
	.string "I'll take it out on you!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_LenaDefeated:
	.string "Fine, you win.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_LenaPostBattle:
	.string "Next time I'm bringing better\n"
	.string "Safari Balls.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_GrantIntro:
	.string "I hiked here from the Safari\n"
	.string "Challenge. Legs like iron!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_GrantDefeated:
	.string "My legs gave out!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_GrantPostBattle:
	.string "Long walk, but worth it.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_IsaacIntro:
	.string "Shh! The river's biting today.\n"
	.string "Battle me quietly.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_IsaacDefeated:
	.string "There goes the catch.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_IsaacPostBattle:
	.string "That river runs under the whole\n"
	.string "bridge. Plenty of fish.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_MarisolIntro:
	.string "My darlings are Safari\n"
	.string "Challenge veterans!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_MarisolDefeated:
	.string "Oh, my darlings!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_MarisolPostBattle:
	.string "They're a bit spoiled, but\n"
	.string "they're still the best.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_NicoIntro:
	.string "Hey! You walked all this way.\n"
	.string "I'll battle you!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_NicoDefeated:
	.string "Too strong!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_NicoPostBattle:
	.string "I'm going to train up and enter\n"
	.string "the Safari Challenge next!$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_AsherIntro:
	.string "Ahem. A traveler!\n"
	.string "I trained these for the Safari.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_AsherDefeated:
	.string "Splendid. You've earned it.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_Text_AsherPostBattle:
	.string "The road ahead is long, but the\n"
	.string "view is magnificent.$"

Route1_CyclingRoad_ARHU_EventScript_DirectionsSign::
